### Test 5: POST crear orden exitosa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "buyer-order-{{$timestamp}}",
  "vendorId": "cmpvxr5er000004l51nrtqen5",
  "buyerId": "Patroclio5",
  "address": "La vuelta de la esquina 123",
  "items": [
    {"productId": "cmpvxs2i3000004l757yjdyph", "quantity": 1}
  ],
  "total": 110
}

### Test 5-2: POST crear orden exitosa con muchos productos
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "buyer-order-{{$timestamp}}",
  "vendorId": "{{vendorId}}",
  "buyerId": "Don Comprador 3",
  "address": "avenida siempre viva 123 depto 12",
  "items": [
    {"productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 2},
    {"productId": "{{productId2}}", "quantity": 1},
    {"productId": "{{productId3}}", "quantity": 3},
    {"productId": "{{productId4}}", "quantity": 1},
    {"productId": "{{productId5}}", "quantity": 4},
    {"productId": "{{productId6}}", "quantity": 2}
  ],
  "total": 119954.00
}


